WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:05.240
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.540
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:38.690
Satoshi and Go have arrived at
Yadon Island, the home of many Yadon.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.730
They have been here before.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.360
It’s been a while.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.570
Today, I’m going to catch
my old rival, Yadon!

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.830
Found them?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.210
There they are!

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.880
So many...

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.920
...Yadon!

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.460
What’cha doin’, Yadon?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.380
What’cha doin’, Yadon?

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:15.220
Had a dream ‘bout wakin’ up with the sun

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.840
Let’s join ‘em!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.720
Wha?!

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:18.680
As it slept ‘til noon, that Yadon

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.680
Man, this feels great...

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.930
Its pink skin isn’t due to being overboiled

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.470
Gah, why...?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.980
It always looked like that, that Yadon

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:24.980
Saton!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:31.940
Its large mouth is like a convenience store; open 24/7, that Yadon

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.060
Go!

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.570
Hold it!
No, no, no!

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:33.110
I did <i>not</i> come here
for a nap!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.450
Its tail is so sweet that...

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:37.030
Monster Ball, go!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.740
...kids sometimes use it as a snack, that Yadon

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.240
It’s so slow that it never ever blurs in photos

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:46.870
Is it proud of that? Yadon...

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.380
Yadon’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:54.380
Yes! I caught a Yadon!

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.840
What’s going on?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.730
What was that just now?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.350
No idea...

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:20.160
When I look at these guys,
all my cares just disappear...

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.120
What?!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.370
Hey!

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.370
Wake up, Satoshi!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.720
Whoa!
Those Yadon have yellow heads!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.140
You’re right.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:49.440
Yadon! Galarian Form! Dopey Pokémon!
Psychic type!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.770
Only found in Galar!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.520
Although it is normally zoned out,

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.570
its expression abruptly sharpens
on occasion!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.780
Galarian Yadon, huh...?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.910
Those guys weren’t here before.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.920
They’re all making
like a “nice to meet you” kinda face.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:15.130
They are?
They all just look zoned out to me...

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.140
I can’t tell what
they’re thinking at all...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.200
Maybe it’s checking the taste.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.320
Yadon tails are
supposed to taste sweet.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.750
I guess it didn’t like the taste.

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.460
Was it bad?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.880
Now that one’s doing it!

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.480
Huh?

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.230
What’s wrong, Yadon?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.120
Are they spicy or something,
Sarunori?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.120
Weren’t they
supposed to be sweet?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.880
Maybe Galarian Yadon
taste different.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:43.300
Because it eats the seeds of Galanuts,
which only grow in Galar,

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.640
its tail has developed
a spicy flavor!

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.640
Huh, so that’s it.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:52.140
Maybe their diet is the reason
they look a bit different, too.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.850
A Yadoran!

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.790
You want those nuts?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.050
Another Yadoran?

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:27.640
That one’s gotta be
a Galarian Yadoran.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.050
It looks a little different.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:38.770
Yadoran! Galarian Form! Hermit Crab Pokémon!
Poison/Psychic type!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.610
If it squeezes the tongue
of the Shellder biting it,

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:45.950
the Shellder will launch a toxic liquid
from the tip of its shell!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.330
They’re not moving at all...

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.290
They gonna battle, maybe?

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.670
I doubt they’re even thinking...

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.870
It had its food stolen...

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:38.080
Are you sure?

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:45.840
Where’s it going?

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:53.890
What’s that?!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:25.710
Yadoking! Galarian Form! Hexing Pokémon!
Poison/Psychic type!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:30.470
A combination of toxins and the shock of evolving
has increased Shellder’s intelligence...

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.260
...to the point that Shellder
now controls Yadoking!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.890
That thing looks pretty scary...

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.470
It really stands out!

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.690
It’s saying something.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.610
A magic spell?!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.430
Psychokinesis?!

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.430
Wh-What’s it trying to do?!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:38.580
Let’s follow ‘em!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.880
Huh?
Was that mountain always here?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.880
I’m certain there was
sea there before...

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.610
Sarunori!

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:15.200
Are you okay?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.580
Up close, it’s even scarier...

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.420
“Follow me”?

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.180
What is this?

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:41.060
This must be their home!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.810
You’re giving them to us?

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.570
Thank you.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.570
What are they?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.160
Galanut seeds!

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:04.750
Galarian Yadon love them!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.420
Huh, so they’re edible?

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.890
Time to dig in!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.560
Too spicy!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.650
But...

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:31.650
So tasty!

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:35.530
I could get...
hooked on these...

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:41.160
Maybe the tails of the Galarian Yadon
turned spicy because they’re always eating these.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.160
Those Galanut seeds were tasty!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:51.630
I get it. You were trying to give the Yadon
these seeds before, to make friends with them.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.920
We should help you out, then!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.480
Hold it...
This couldn’t mean...

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.650
I have to relive that nightmare?!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.240
I knew it!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.330
Hey, Satoshi...

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.300
Come on, come on, come on!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:38.420
I’m Galarian Satoking!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.470
Tell the historian
today I’m changing!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.390
Come back to me, Satoshi!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.470
I’m always gonna be
a sen-sa-tion!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.060
When my rap hits
there ain’t no con-ten-tion!

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.310
Yo, yo, yo!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.730
Guh...
This is hopeless...

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:58.780
The Index said Galarian Yadoking
were controlled by Shellder...

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:03.070
Does that mean Satoshi’s
being controlled by Shellder, too?

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.780
Cor-rec-to!
Thank you so!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.370
Lotsa nice guys in
this Galarian band!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.750
Makes me wanna
lend ‘em a hand, yo!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.790
Yo, yo! Help me out, yo!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.550
I don’t really get it,
but you want me to help, too?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.510
Cor-rec-to! Tosakin-to!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.560
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.890
Okay. Right, right.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.020
With the Yadon?
Got it.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.400
You. Got. It. Bro.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:44.910
But how do you intend to make the Yadon
and the Galarian Yadon friends after that?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.410
Yo! I got myself a master plan!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.700
Lemme worry ‘bout it,
gonna be utopian!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.330
We gon’ crush it, macho man!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.880
Everyone! Listen up!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.880
That Galarian Yadoking’s
band from before...

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.510
They might look a little scary...

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:08.050
But they’re not bad guys!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.810
You’re all part of
the Yadon family!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.940
Could you go
and meet with them again?

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:24.400
No, I still can’t tell anything
from those expressions...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:28.160
Well, the Yadon are clustered
pretty close together already...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.540
Yadoking!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:42.670
It’s been a while!

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:43.960
Have you been doing well?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:46.970
You’ve got great timing!

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:48.550
Hey, Yadoking...

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.140
Right now,
Galarian Yadon are visiting this isla—

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.350
Yo! Thanks for waiting, yo! Yo!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:57.600
Yo, yo, yo!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.980
Galarian Satoking
is on the scene!

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:10.240
Wh-What’s that pot for?!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.370
Come on, Go!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.630
A ladle?

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.500
Time to rap battle!
Hey, come on!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.800
Whaaaaat?!

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:29.010
Huh?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.470
No way...

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.430
Wait... Stop!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.980
Goking has arrived!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.530
Yo, Goking!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.370
Hey, Satoking!

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:52.990
Yo!

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:53.740
Hey!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.910
Put your hands up!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.750
Here we go!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:01.250
Yo! Yo! Yo!
Battle with me, Goking!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:05.750
Hey! Hey! Hey!
Let’s have a rap battle, Satoking!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.800
Yo! Yo, yo, curry time, yo!
Tasty, yo!

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:14.510
Spicy, yo! Yo, yo, curry time, yo!
Spicy, yo! Tasty, yo!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.770
No! No! No!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:21.190
Udon only, I’m on a spree!
That’s a Yadon guarantee!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.270
I’m sorry!
Some more for me!

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.370
I’m Galarian Satoking!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.410
Gimme some Galanuts
and I’m cooking!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.660
Crazy spice, curry’s my choice!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.040
Eat it and you’ll be friends,
forever!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.800
What’cha sayin’?!
Try again!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.970
When ya think Yadon,
ya gotta have udon!

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.140
What’cha sayin’?!
Try again!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.680
We don’t need curry!
Sorry, not curry!

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:09.320
Curry is heavenly!
Oh, it’s lovely!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:11.530
Missing out is hell!
You’re outta your shell!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.610
Udon’s the best,
beats out the rest!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.740
Chewy and tough,
and revolutionary broth!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.200
This is the life, so here we go!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.750
Yo! Yo! Yo, yo, yo!

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:27.130
Hey! Hey! Hey, hey, hey!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.880
Yo! Yo! Yo, yo, yo!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.960
Hey! Hey! Hey, hey, hey!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:31.590
Yo!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.220
Hey!

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:32.720
Yo!

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:33.380
Hey!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.530
Curry... udon?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.830
How the heck?!

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:31.230
Yo! That looks tasty!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.360
Hey! Why don’t we try some?

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.580
Yo! What is this, yo?

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.370
The flavor’s off the chain!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.540
For real, straight outta some god’s pantry!
Our cookery!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.000
This is a discovery!
Utter victory!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.630
Yo! Yo!

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:51.630
Hey! Hey!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.750
Yo, yo, yo!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.050
Hey, hey, hey!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.520
That was great.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.310
Isn’t that nice?

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:47.180
Yeah!

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.450
W-Wow...

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:25.350
Let’s meet again somewhere!

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.560
Take care!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.900
See ya!

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.320
And so,
Galarian Yadoking’s band set off.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:41.610
Perhaps they’re off to plant Galanut trees
all over the world...

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:09.580
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:10.830
Go!

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:16.080
So this is
the Pokémon Circus tent?

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:21.800
We’ll get to see them evolve
into Thunders and Booster!

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:24.970
The evolution stones...

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.970
...swapped around?!

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.850
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:33.350
The Pokémon Circus!
Booster and Thunders!!
